      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-whatsapp",
      "description": "Deep-green user-initiated action that opens a direct WhatsApp chat with +8613380262499 and the localized product introduction; the visitor confirms sending.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-btn-whatsapp\" href=\"https://wa.me/8613380262499?text=TTK-3700E%20%E2%80%94%20A%20PFAS-free%20polymer%20processing%20aid%20masterbatch%20in%20an%20LDPE%20carrier%2C%20designed%20to%20reduce%20die%20build-up%20and%20melt%20fracture%20in%20polyolefin%20extrusion.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Chat via WhatsApp<small>+8613380262499</small></span><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h16v12H9l-5 4Z\"/><path d=\"M8 8h8M8 12h5\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-whatsapp{display:inline-flex;width:100%;min-height:45px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:11px 15px;color:#ffffff;background:#147d64;border:1px solid #147d64;border-radius:6px;font-family:var(--font);font-size:12px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}.ds-btn-whatsapp small{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.ds-btn-whatsapp:hover{background:#0f684f;border-color:#0f684f}.ds-btn-whatsapp:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3b82e6;outline-offset:3px}.ds-icon{width:1.2em;height:1.2em;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.65;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Email Contact Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-email",
      "description": "Cobalt mailto action that opens a draft addressed to carwyn910@gmail.com with subject TTK-3700E and the localized product introduction; the visitor reviews and sends it.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-btn-email\" href=\"mailto:carwyn910@gmail.com?subject=TTK-3700E&amp;body=TTK-3700E%20%E2%80%94%20A%20PFAS-free%20polymer%20processing%20aid%20masterbatch%20in%20an%20LDPE%20carrier%2C%20designed%20to%20reduce%20die%20build-up%20and%20melt%20fracture%20in%20polyolefin%20extrusion.\"><span>Send by email<small>carwyn910@gmail.com</small></span><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"m3 6 9 7 9-7\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-email{display:inline-flex;width:100%;min-height:45px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:11px 15px;color:#ffffff;background:#1565d8;border:1px solid #1565d8;border-radius:6px;font-family:var(--font);font-size:12px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}.ds-btn-email small{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.ds-btn-email:hover{background:#0d51b1;border-color:#0d51b1}.ds-btn-email:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3b82e6;outline-offset:3px}.ds-icon{width:1.2em;height:1.2em;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.65;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Section Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-link",
      "description": "Compact desktop section links with a cobalt hover underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Section navigation\"><a href=\"#product\">Product</a><a href=\"#applications\">Applications</a><a href=\"#performance\">Performance</a><a href=\"#resources\">Resources</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px}.ds-nav a{position:relative;color:#425a74;font-family:var(--font);font-size:12px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.55;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.ds-nav a:after{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:-8px;left:0;height:2px;background:var(--accent);content:'';transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .2s ease}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}.ds-nav a:hover:after{transform:scaleX(1)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3b82e6;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Application Tab",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "scenario-tab",
      "description": "Photographic tab with a pale selected wash and cobalt selected border.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-scene-tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\"><img class=\"ds-scene-thumb\" src=\"assets/images/hygiene.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" alt=\"\"><span>Hygiene</span><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-scene-tab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px minmax(0,1fr) 18px;min-width:0;min-height:70px;align-items:center;padding:0;overflow:hidden;color:var(--ink);background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;transition:background .2s,border-color .2s}.ds-scene-tab:hover{border-color:#88a9d0}.ds-scene-tab[aria-selected=true]{background:#e3efff;border-color:var(--accent)}.ds-scene-thumb{width:70px;height:70px;object-fit:cover}.ds-scene-tab span{min-width:0;padding:9px 10px;font-family:var(--font);font-size:12px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4}.ds-icon{width:15px;height:15px;margin-right:9px;color:var(--accent);fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.65;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;opacity:0}.ds-scene-tab[aria-selected=true] .ds-icon{opacity:1}.ds-scene-tab:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3b82e6;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:680px){.ds-scene-tab{grid-template-columns:52px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:60px;border-radius:8px}.ds-scene-thumb{width:52px;height:60px}.ds-scene-tab span{padding:8px}.ds-scene-tab .ds-icon{display:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Application Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "scenario-panel",
      "description": "Compact application detail with a text-forward grid and a capped real-scene photograph so subapplications and process guidance remain in the same reading viewport.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-scenario-panel\"><div>Application details and subapplication rows</div><figure><img src=\"assets/images/hygiene.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Diapers arranged in a basket\"><figcaption>Illustrative industry photograph</figcaption></figure></article>",
      "css": ".ds-scenario-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(360px,.92fr);gap:24px;padding:22px;color:var(--ink);background:#f5fbf8;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}.ds-scenario-panel img{width:100%;height:260px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}@media(max-width:960px){.ds-scenario-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:680px){.ds-scenario-panel img{height:auto;max-height:280px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Specification Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "spec-card",
      "description": "Flat technical-data card with ruled definition rows and tabular values.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-spec-card\"><div class=\"ds-spec-head\"><h3>Technical data</h3><span>TTK-3700E</span></div><dl><div><dt>Active content</dt><dd>5.00%</dd></div><div><dt>Carrier resin</dt><dd>LDPE</dd></div><div><dt>Form</dt><dd>Milky-white pellets</dd></div></dl></article>",
      "css": ".ds-spec-card{padding:24px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;font-family:var(--font)}.ds-spec-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.ds-spec-head h3{margin:0;font-size:21px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-spec-head span{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em}.ds-spec-card dl{margin:17px 0 12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-spec-card dl>div{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e2eaf2}.ds-spec-card dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.ds-spec-card dd{margin:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;text-align:right}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Qualification Badge",
      "kind": "chip",
